<title>NETHERLANDS: RODAMCO SEES 97/98 NET/SHR UP BY 10 PCT.</title>
<headline>RODAMCO SEES 97/98 NET/SHR UP BY 10 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch property investment fund Rodamco, part of the Robeco Group, on Tuesday reiterated an earlier forecast that it expected its 1997/98 net earnings per share to increase by around 10 percent to 3.00 guilders.  </p>
<p>&quot;During 1997/98, recent acquisitions will prompt a distinct growth in net profit per share compared with the current financial year,&quot; it said, adding that an earlier forecast of a 10 percent rise to three guilders per share did not take into account any favourable moves from future investments or currency and interest rates.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
